\ cv8b-kinput.4 - the input side made faster (Iteration 54), for the
\ byte-header system with kfast; loaded after cv8b-kfast.4 for designs
\ with the gene kinput. X8 words: the kernel's word gets the body.
\
\ On seed 12's fastest design, REFILL, SCAN, PARSE, SKIP and WORD were
\ 27-36% of the kernel, parse and corpus workloads' dispatches. Most of
\ REFILL's share is its tab loop - ten dispatches a character of every
\ line read. Factored out here, unchanged, as TABS>BL, which the gene
\ makes a format-10 opcode with SCAN, SKIP and FILL (lab/evolve).

: TABS>BL ( c-addr u --- )
\ Every tab in the string a space - REFILL's loop.
  OVER + SWAP BEGIN 2DUP - WHILE DUP C@ 9 = IF BL OVER C! THEN 1+ REPEAT 2DROP ;

: REFILL8 ( --- f)
\ The kernel's REFILL, its tab loop TABS>BL.
  SOURCE-ID -1 = IF
   0 \ Not refillable for EVALUATE
  ELSE
   SOURCE-ID IF
    SRC @ 256 SOURCE-ID READ-LINE ABORT" Error reading file"
    SWAP #SRC ! 0 >IN !
    #SRC @ IF SOURCE TABS>BL THEN
   ELSE
    QUERY #TIB @ #SRC ! 0 >IN ! -1 \ Always successful from terminal.
   THEN
  THEN ;
